OL,3,GNEWSATrains halted after person found
OL,4,Adead on tracks
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain services on the main west coast
OL,7,Ftrain route were suspended during the
OL,8,Fmorning rush hour on Monday, after a
OL,9,Fperson was found dead on the tracks in
OL,10,FLancashire.
OL,12,FBritish Transport Police (BTP) said
OL,13,Fofficers were called to Leyland railway
OL,14,Fstation just before 07:00 BST,
OL,15,Ffollowing reports of a casualty on the
OL,16,Ftracks. Paramedics also attended, with
OL,17,Fthe person pronounced dead at the
OL,18,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
