OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATrains halted after person found
OL,4,Adead on tracks
OL,5,
OL,6,FAvanti West Coast initially said lines
OL,7,Fwere closed between Preston and Wigan
OL,8,FNorth Western due to "emergency
OL,9,Fservices managing an incident", but
OL,10,Flater said lines had re-opened. It
OL,11,Fwarned "residual delays and some
OL,12,Falterations are expected".
OL,14,FTranspennine Express also said
OL,15,Fdisruption was expected until 10:30
OL,16,FBST.
